00:46:26.356 --> 00:46:29.595
So, just replace that piece
of it using a normal B-tree,

00:46:29.596 --> 00:46:33.135
and you get the normal
guarantees for it.

00:46:33.136 --> 00:46:34.250
The nice thing of doing that,

00:46:34.251 --> 00:46:36.260
is the worst case performance in

00:46:36.261 --> 00:46:38.560
the end is the one of
just like the B-tree,

00:46:38.561 --> 00:46:41.665
because from the worst-case
just re-grates to a B-tree.

00:46:41.666 --> 00:46:43.780
We started out with that it turns

