00:48:52.061 --> 00:48:53.450
how do you still rebalance?

00:48:53.451 --> 00:48:54.820
But there's something like robust

00:48:54.821 --> 00:48:56.710
machine learning which
takes care of that,

00:48:56.711 --> 00:48:58.705
so there are
new approaches there.

00:48:58.706 --> 00:49:01.125
The second question
is like paging.

00:49:01.126 --> 00:49:03.250
Often what we have is just
that we want to page there,

00:49:03.251 --> 00:49:04.510
particularly if it's on disk.

00:49:04.511 --> 00:49:07.130
Here, one simple solution
