00:49:26.130 --> 00:49:29.855
So we started with B-trees,

00:49:29.856 --> 00:49:31.970
but it turned out
like the same idea

00:49:31.971 --> 00:49:33.100
also applies to many,

00:49:33.101 --> 00:49:35.220
many other data
structures, from 'Join',

00:49:35.221 --> 00:49:37.660
'Sorting', "Hash-Map'
'Bloom-Filters', 'Priority Queues'.

